    "开启后，菜单栏会显示「智能切换」入口；后台监测到当前 Codex 账号 5h/7d 配额耗尽时，会自动切换到更优账号并重启 Codex。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "When enabled, the menu bar shows Smart Switch. If the current Codex account exhausts its 5h/7d quota, OpenPulse automatically switches to a better account and restarts Codex."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
